    "gaps": [
      "Scientific helper internals and their five sequential subprocess validators remain opaque inside native write_case.",
      "This graph models main after CLI parsing, not the hub subprocess envelope. Caller owns dry-run output and the hub post-run write audit; write_case checks mutation authorization and source preflight.",
      "Ten iterations specialize the fixed source CASES; exhaustion is unreachable at the native bound. Shorter descriptor bounds fail without aggregate output.",
      "Descriptor time and operation budgets are enforced by Lunar, not the native CLI. Native child validators have no timeout.",
      "Native diagnostics are forwarded to MCP stderr; workflow stdout is returned as a typed value. Native reports remain source-owned; runtime receipts do not establish scientific truth."
    ]
  },
